@startuml autonomous-service-execution-boundary
title Autonomous Service Execution Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Service\n<<semantic>>" as autosvc
class "Execution Mechanism\n<<technology>>" as exec

autosvc --> exec : realized through

note right of exec
  May include:
  - Human
  - Agent
  - System
  - Service
  - Workflow
  - Agentic Workflow
end note

note bottom of autosvc
  Material autonomous progression
  required per CR-ES-015 §8
end note
@enduml
